"At-Risk Behavior":3},"details":[{"date":"2026-03-29","observer":"John Draper Jr","type":"At-Risk Condition","description":"Rig hand standing on pipe ","location":"Casing ","service_line":"Casing","report_number":"78101428","yard":"Midland"},{"date":"2026-03-29","observer":"Daniel Carlos","type":"Recognition","description":"Clean well organized rug","location":"Pulling unit","service_line":"Casing","report_number":"78097171","yard":"Midland"},{"date":"2026-03-29","observer":"Joao Demenjon","type":"At-Risk Behavior","description":"I didn't mention it in my previous observation card because I personally told corrected him about using the phone in front of me.\nThis San Angelo hand \"jimmy\" didn't come to a job he knew we had in 12 hours leaving us short handed. My hands are telling me when I wasn't there he was constantly on the phone, both in the dog house and on the rig floor near the rotary table.\nHe also called his girlfriend in front of my hands and told her not to worry that he wouldn't be going on this next job because they had plans.\n\nThis kind of behavior is so common and it leaves the rest of us in a bind, I really think he needs to be written up.","location":"Citadel 6 run 9k 85/8","service_line":"Casing","report_number":"78090578","yard":"Midland"},{"date":"2026-03-29","observer":"Yan Cantu","type":"At-Risk Condition","description":"Running casing good no issues ","location":"PU","service_line":"Casing","report_number":"78087191","yard":"Midland"},{"date":"2026-03-29","observer":"Emilio Moreno","type":"At-Risk Condition","description":"En la penultima pipa al jalar las hand slip se giraron ","location":"Burton tx.","service_line":"Casing","report_number":"78085879","yard":"Bryan"},{"date":"2026-03-29","observer":"Julio Moreno","type":"At-Risk Condition","description":"Fuga de aceite de las pinzas ","location":"Burton's tx","service_line":"Casing","report_number":"78085470","yard":"Bryan"},{"date":"2026-03-29","observer":"Joao Demenjon","type":"Recognition","description":"My guys worked really well together, Jaime Arzola really shined when we had to throw back ups every other joint due to collar spinning when pulling pipe.\n\nI'd keep an eye on that hand \"jimmy\", not fully paying attention, could get hurt. ","location":"Run 9k 8 5:8 then pull the string  Pyote citadel 6","service_line":"Casing","report_number":"78082620","yard":"Midland"},{"date":"2026-03-29","observer":"Stanly Chirchir","type":"Recognition","description":"Job well done ","location":"H&P 510","service_line":"Casing","report_number":"78075855","yard":"Midland"},{"date":"2026-03-29","observer":"Kelvin Kozerani","type":"Recognition","description":"Clean floor no trip hazards ","location":"H&P 510 casing","service_line":"Casing","report_number":"78075815","yard":"Midland"},{"date":"2026-03-29","observer":"Jaime Arzola","type":"At-Risk Behavior","description":"Everything went well nobody was hurt. Most importantly the behavior was outstanding.. 2 different crews but everybody got along.","location":"Citadel 6","service_line":"Casing","report_number":"78072891","yard":"Midland"},{"date":"2026-03-29","observer":"Luis Ocampo","type":"At-Risk Behavior","description":"Had had his back turned while a tool was swinging in. ","location":"Hp 475 crossing over to 5.5in ","service_line":"Casing","report_number":"78072523","yard":"Bryan"}]},"near_misses":[],"incidents":[],"assessments":{"total":14,"details":[{"date":"2026-03-29","assessor":"Gustavo Dominguez Jr","form_id":229645,"form_name":"CSG - Pre/Post Trip Inspection","division":"Casing","location":"","report_number":"78101524"},{"date":"2026-03-29","assessor":"James Sellers","form_id":229645,"form_name":"CSG - Pre/Post Trip Inspection","division":"Casing","location":"","report_number":"78100969"},{"date":"2026-03-29","assessor":"James Sellers","form_id":229645,"form_name":"CSG - Pre/Post Trip Inspection","division":"Casing","location":"","report_number":"78100949"},{"date":"2026-03-29","assessor":"Mitchell